                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "239468018",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561198362005736",
                            "num_reviews": 43,
                            "playtime_forever": 55,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 55,
                            "last_played": 1762756720
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "While I haven't played this game much on Steam, I've played this a ton on console and it's a great, hectic party game to play with friends! Controls pretty good, boppin' Genesis-esque soundtrack, fun weapons, and fast-paced versus gameplay make for a great party game experience! One thing the Steam version has that console doesn't is that you can actually customize a hat for your duck and it's honestly pretty easy if you have basic knowledge of Microsoft Paint. I'm not the most mod savvy and even I was able to figure it out, and it comes out pretty well if done right. I will admit that if you don't have friends to play it with that the single player campaign, while decently fun, is very short-lived. But with some friends, it's a blast!",
